 class="lc-data">18</span> comparable listings · AE AE</span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data font-medium">AED&nbsp;1,850,000</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-pill border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-[var(--lc-status-warning-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-warning-fg)] border-transparent" aria-label="Above benchmark by 18.4 percent"><span aria-hidden="true">▲</span><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">+18.4% above benchmark</span></span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><span class="text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]"><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">12</span> comps · <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">5</span> files</span></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" aria-label="High risk composite; delta drives tier; tenure is low; delta is high"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none w-fit border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-published-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-published-fg)]">Tenure low</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none w-fit border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-warning-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-warning-fg)]">Delta high</div></div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-draft-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-draft-fg)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="me-1">○</span>Pending review</div></td><td class="px-3 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border bg-[var(--lc-surface)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3 border-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary)]" type="button">Incorporate</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3" type="button">Signal only</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3" type="button">Reject</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border bg-[var(--lc-surface)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3 border-[var(--lc-status-warning-fg)] text-[var(--lc-status-warning-fg)]" type="button">Request info</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3" type="button">Open</button></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><footer class="mt-[var(--lc-space-md)] flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]"><span><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">1</span>–<span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">1</span> of <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">1</span></span><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3" type="button" disabled="">Previous</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3" type="button" disabled="">Next</button></div></footer></div></div></div></body></html>"
