ter justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-[var(--lc-status-warning-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-warning-fg)] ring-2 ring-[var(--lc-accent-bold-edge)] motion-safe:animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none">?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-sm text-[var(--lc-status-warning-dot)]">○</span><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]">Awaiting second reviewer</span></div></div></div><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">First sign-off <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data" title="2026-09-10T11:45:00.000Z">5d ago</span></p></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 mt-2 min-h-tap w-full" type="button" data-second-approver-trigger="true">Cast second-approver vote</button><p class="text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]">Awaiting second approver · <a class="text-[var(--lc-text-brand)] underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/admin/fin/approvals?id=apr_req_1">Open approval request →</a></p></div><div id="decision-panel" class="sticky bottom-[var(--lc-space-lg)] rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] p-[var(--lc-space-lg)]"></div><section aria-labelledby="timeline-heading" class="flex w-full flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)]" data-timeline="true"><h3 id="timeline-heading" class="text-[var(--lc-text-heading)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-3);">Audit trail</h3><ol class="relative m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)] p-0"><li class="relative flex gap-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><div class="flex w-4 shrink-0 flex-col items-center"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-2