 data-weight-mode="signal_only" data-weight="50" aria-label="Signal weighting" class="rounded-lg bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] p-[var(--lc-space-lg)]" dir="ltr"><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">Applied weight: <strong data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data font-semibold" aria-label="50 percent">50%</strong></p><div class="relative mt-[var(--lc-space-md)] h-3 w-full"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-sm)] bg-[var(--lc-border)]" aria-hidden="true"></div><div role="meter" aria-valuenow="50" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-label="Signal weight applied by Platform Administrator" class="absolute inset-y-0 start-0 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-sm)] bg-[var(--lc-accent-bold)] outline outline-1 outline-[var(--lc-accent-bold-edge)]" style="width: 50%;"></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[var(--lc-border-strong)]" style="left: 25%;"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[var(--lc-border-strong)]" style="left: 50%;"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[var(--lc-border-strong)]" style="left: 75%;"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-[var(--lc-border-strong)]" style="left: 100%;"></span></div><p class="mt-[var(--lc-space-md)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">Your signal is being <strong>weighted alongside other signals</strong> in Dubai Marina · 2-3BR apartments.</p></section><div id="price-original-report"><div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] shadow-sm"><h2 class="sr-only">What you originally submitted</h2><button type="button" class="flex min-h-tap w-full items-center justify-between gap-[var(--lc-space-md)] px-[var(--lc-space-md)] py-[var(--lc-space-sm)] text-start" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls=":r3h:"><span class="text-[var(--lc-text-heading)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">What